---
description: draw.io .drawio XML roadmap/flowchart output format (mxfile/mxCell)
globs: **/*.drawio
alwaysApply: false
---

## Goal

When asked to “generate a roadmap / route map / flowchart as a `.drawio` file”, output **valid draw.io XML** using the canonical structure shown in typical Electron exports.

## Minimal required structure (must keep)

- Root wrapper: `<mxfile><diagram><mxGraphModel><root> ... </root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>`
- Always include the two base cells:
  - `<mxCell id="0" />`
  - `<mxCell id="1" parent="0" />`

## Nodes (steps)

- Use `<mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" value="...">` for each step.
- Include an `<mxGeometry ... as="geometry" />` with `x`, `y`, `width`, `height`.
- Prefer short, action-oriented Chinese labels in `value` (e.g. “数据预处理与质控”).
- Keep `style` stable; vary only colors/roundedness to convey categories.

## Edges (connections)

- Use `<mxCell edge="1" parent="1" source="NODE_ID" target="NODE_ID" style="...">`
  with `<mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />`.
- Use orthogonal routing by default: `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;...`

## Layout + readability conventions

- Top-to-bottom mainline: keep consistent vertical spacing (e.g. \(y += 100\)).
- Side branches: place to left/right and connect from mainline nodes.
- Use color meaning consistently across the whole diagram (example mapping):
  - Main stages: light red (`fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;`)
  - Sub-steps/tools: light blue (`fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;`)
  - Modeling/compute: light yellow (`fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;`)
  - Validation/integration: light purple (`fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;`)

## Template snippet (copy shape, replace IDs/labels/coords)

```xml
<mxfile host="Electron" version="29.x.x">
  <diagram name="第 1 页" id="DIAGRAM_ID">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0"/>
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
        <mxCell id="STEP_A" parent="1" vertex="1"
          style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;"
          value="阶段 A">
          <mxGeometry x="-640" y="20" width="120" height="60" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="EDGE_A_B" parent="1" edge="1" source="STEP_A" target="STEP_B"
          style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
```
